# Neon Postgres connection URL — the TEST branch, a SEPARATE Neon branch from the one in .env.
# Do NOT copy .env's DATABASE_URL here, even temporarily to unblock `npm test`: every DB test
# TRUNCATEs all core tables in beforeEach (see src/test/reset-db.ts), so pointing this at the
# same branch as .env silently wipes real dev data. If you don't have the test-branch URL, ask
# the project owner or create a new branch in the Neon console rather than reusing .env's.
# src/test/global-setup.ts refuses to run migrations if this matches .env's DATABASE_URL.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:pass@host/db?sslmode=require"
